{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》中深受網民喜愛的「另類 CP」KC（歐瑞偉飾）與Terry（李偉健飾），在今晚（16日）的劇情中再度發功！KC得知Terry受傷後，不但緊張探病，更上演一幕深情剝橙餵食，畫面充滿粉紅泡泡！當Terry尷尬表白自己取向時，KC的一句神回應，瞬間讓曖昧指數爆燈！\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情曖昧升溫 KC緊張探病餵食Terry</h2>\n<p>劇情講述開心小棧老闆Terry（李偉健飾）意外受傷，與他關係密切的KC（歐瑞偉飾）得知後大為緊張，立即趕往探病。心急如焚的KC更主動為Terry剝橙，並溫柔地遞到對方嘴邊。令人意想不到的是，Terry竟非常順從，自然地伸出頭來讓KC餵食，兩人之間流露出的默契與親密感，讓整個畫面儼如充滿粉紅泡泡，氣氛極度曖昧。</p>\n<h2>Terry尷尬表白：我對男人冇興趣 KC神回一句</h2>\n<p>正當氣氛甜到漏之際，Terry似乎察覺到兩人的舉動有點不妥，隨即尷尬地說：「我唔知點解自己會咁㗎，不過我對男人冇興趣。」這句突如其來的「表白」本應打破曖昧，誰知KC竟神回一句：「我覺得冇問題喎，當然我都對男人冇興趣。」兩人隨後更深情互望，這段充滿遐想的對白，加上曖昧的眼神交流，保證令一眾支持他們的粉絲尖叫連連。</p>\n<h2>回顧KCTerry「最強HeHe」之路</h2>\n<p>KC與Terry這對「最強HeHe」組合，一直是《愛．回家》系列中最受歡迎的CP之一。<b>初期</b>，兩人只是單純的上下屬關係，但隨著劇情發展，KC對「孱雞」Terry的百般照顧與改造，讓他們的關係逐漸昇華。<b>經典場面</b>包括KC教Terry做運動、為他解決各種大小麻煩，甚至多次上演英雄救「美」的戲碼，每次互動都充滿笑料與火花。兩人早已超越普通朋友的界線，成為觀眾心目中密不可分的靈魂伴侶。</p>\n<h2>粉絲尖叫連連：官方逼死同人</h2>\n<p>KC與Terry再次大派福利，網民早已準備好「食花生」，並紛紛激動留言！有粉絲尖叫道：「OMG！餵食橙！仲要深情對望！官方逼死同人啊！」亦有網民笑指Terry的對白非常可疑：「Terry句『我對男人冇興趣』根本就係此地無銀三百兩，笑死！」更多人將焦點放在KC的回應上：「KC個回應先係重點：『我覺得冇問題喎』，潛台詞係『我OK喎』！」、「求編劇俾佢哋一個正式名份啦！畫面粉紅泡泡多到就快爆mon！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7313347396afa8290c81ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7313347396afa8290c81ee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_6324481046afa829e99677.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_6324481046afa829e99677.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_13748024196afa82a3d53ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_13748024196afa82a3d53ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_6604420276afa82a83eace.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_6604420276afa82a83eace.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_3202594806afa82af3d177.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_3202594806afa82af3d177.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.692293+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1202,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:30:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:36.078414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:36.078414+00:00","content_hash":"c485c52de3937ca5c4280cfc19d50736d29ad1dd318dabc9e4149bf9b17a8120","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}